    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1200
  },
  {
    "id": 2016019110020,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ありがとうございます\r\nもう少し、こうした方がいい、という所はありませんか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601911/2016019110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、千雪が一番知りたいのは\r\nそこだもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016019110030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ごめんなさい、つい前のめりに\r\nなってしまって……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601911/2016019110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、大丈夫だよ\r\nそれだけ意欲的だってことだもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
