    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1700
  },
  {
    "id": 2016019110140,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ですから、プロデューサーさん\r\n先ほどの質問への、私の答えは……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601911/2016019110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2016019110150,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "アーティスト、アイドル\r\n２つを同時にやっていく覚悟は",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601911/2016019110150"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 400
  },
  {
    "id": 2016019110160,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あります",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601911/2016019110160",
    "autoWaitTime": 1100
  },
  {
    "id": 2016019110170,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "常に前向きな挑戦を続けなくちゃ\r\n輝き続けることは、できませんから",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201601911/2016019110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……わかった\r\nその言葉が聞けて、嬉しいよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪が輝き続けられるよう\r\nこれからも全力でサポートするから、よろしくな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
